等相关机构进行审阅。在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时，向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。","quote_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","span_id":"es_342cfc57d67b67"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","quote":"临床研究开始前，必须通过启动会或研究者会议对所有参加研究的人员进行研究 方案的培训，使每个参研人员都对临床研究方案及其各指标具体内涵有充分理解和认识、掌握 GCP 原则、统一记录方式与判断标准、严格按照方案执行。培训必须在该临床试验机构入选受试者之前进行。","quote_sha256":"a668438495209c1a93ff8056f3ef958a45b23c7f699057c8114de2ccc026a93e","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","span_id":"es_a5809e9c89c84d"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_cebb133a914e24","es_544d5795fdc791","es_342cfc57d67b67","es_a5809e9c89c84d"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":4,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充本项目药物依从性核查方式（如注射记录、药物回收）及监查中依从性检查频率","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_1_compliance_monitoring","missing_source_classes":["项目级质量控制计划","监查计划"],"target":"12.1节中依从性监测方法与频率"},{"action":"确认各中心启动会培训的具体内容清单、考核方式及培训记录保存要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_1_training_detail","missing_source_classes":["培训SOP","中心启动检查清单"],"target":"12.1节中培训考核与记录要求"}],"heading":"研究方案的依从","missing_source_classes":["项目级质量控制计划","各中心培训与考核SOP","依从性监测操作细则"],"proposal_text":"本研究的实施将严格遵循本方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、中国药物临床试验质量管理规范、ICH-GCP E6（R3）以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。研究者承诺按照中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。临床研究开始前，必须通过启动会或研究者会议对所有参加研究的人员进行研究方案的培训，使每个参研人员都对临床研究方案及其各指标具体内涵有充分理解和认识、掌握GCP原则、统一记录方式与判断标准、严格按照方案执行；培训必须在该临床试验机构入选受试者之前进行。本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅；在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。","rationale":"依据公司语料中GCP合规条款、培训要求及保密条款撰写框架性依从声明。本项目为多中心III期研究，已确认设立DMC，但允许来源中未提供本项目具体的依从性监测方法（如药物回收计数、注射记录核查频率）、各中心培训考核标准及保密协议模板，需医学经理确认是否需补充项目特异的依从性管理细则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_7adf90faf5d51f63","section_number":"12.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:779e0467d0a3503adeb1d7b4","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006024354_b5ff2d93","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我将根据中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"es_544d5795fdc791"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","quote":"DMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"9967a9a75297ced2326ab733fa3b16934acdef641fa765dd50c1cd58219f4aa5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","span_id":"es_study_def_dmc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","span_id":"es_study_def_multicenter"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_544d5795fdc791","es_study_def_dmc","es_study_def_multicenter"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认各中心监查访视频率、监查报告格式及监查员职责范围","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_2_monitoring_frequency","missing_source_classes":["项目级监查计划"],"target":"12.2节中监查频率与内容"},{"action":"补充DMC章程、会议频率、安全性数据审阅范围及与监查体系的衔接方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_2_dmc_operational","missing_source_classes":["DMC章程","DMC职责文件"],"target":"12.2节中DMC运作规则"}],"heading":"监查","missing_source_classes":["项目级监查计划","DMC章程","监查报告模板","DMC会议安排与职责文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心临床研究，申办者将派遣临床监查员对各研究中心进行定期监查，以确保研究按照本方案、GCP及适用法规执行。研究者同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。本研究计划设立数据安全监察委员会，对研究进行过程中的安全性数据进行定期审阅，以保障受试者权益和研究数据的完整性。监查员在每次访视中应核查受试者筛选与入组记录、知情同意书签署情况、方案规定的各项评估与给药记录、不良事件报告及病例报告表填写的完整性与准确性。","rationale":"依据公司语料中研究者接受监查的GCP条款及本项目已确认的DMC设立事实撰写。本项目为多中心设计且已确认DMC计划，但允许来源中未提供监查频率、监查报告模板、DMC章程及会议安排、监查与DMC之间的信息传递机制等项目级实施文件，需医学经理确认具体监查方案。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_e777bf567c257611","section_number":"12.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:779e0467d0a3503adeb1d7b4","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006024354_b5ff2d93","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我将根据中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"es_544d5795fdc791"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","quote":"本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，因此，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时，向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。","quote_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","span_id":"es_342cfc57d67b67"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_544d5795fdc791","es_342cfc57d67b67"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认申办者稽查计划、稽查频率、稽查范围及报告流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_3_audit_plan","missing_source_classes":["项目级稽查计划"],"target":"12.3节中稽查计划与频率"},{"action":"确认药品监督管理部门核查时的资料准备、人员配合及记录保存要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_3_inspection_response","missing_source_classes":["核查应对SOP"],"target":"12.3节中核查应对流程"}],"heading":"稽查和核查","missing_source_classes":["项目级稽查计划","核查应对SOP","资料准备清单"],"proposal_text":"研究者同意接受申办者派遣稽查员对本次临床研究的稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。申办者保留在研究期间或研究结束后对研究中心进行独立稽查的权利，稽查范围包括但不限于研究方案的依从性、数据记录的完整性与可溯源性、试验用药品管理、受试者权益保护及不良事件报告等。药品监督管理部门有权依据适用法规对研究中心进行核查，研究者应配合核查工作并提供所需文件与记录。本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，稽查与核查过程中涉及的研究资料仅限相关监管机构及申办者稽查人员按职责范围查阅，不得向与本研究无关的第三方披露。","rationale":"依据公司语料中研究者接受稽查与视查的GCP条款及保密条款撰写。允许来源中未提供本项目稽查计划、稽查频率、核查应对流程及资料准备清单等项目级文件，需医学经理确认稽查与核查的具体操作安排。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_c0a619ded602e7d0","section_number":"12.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:779e0467d0a3503adeb1d7b4","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006024354_b5ff2d93","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","quote":"根据 GCP 要求，未经申办者和 EC 的同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案，但不包括为了及时消除对受试者的紧急危害或者更换监查员、电话号码等仅涉及临床 试验管理方面的改动。","quote_sha256":"76042946d5684aaa9636ba63055710074755cd90e1cbcdea361b478c726f510b","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","span_id":"es_3d78c7bb1bd24f"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","quote":"DMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"9967a9a75297ced2326ab733fa3b16934acdef641fa765dd50c1cd58219f4aa5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","span_id":"es_study_def_dmc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","span_id":"es_study_def_multicenter"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_3d78c7bb1bd24f","es_study_def_dmc","es_study_def_multicenter"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认重大方案偏离与一般方案偏离的界定标准及对应报告路径","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_4_deviation_classification","missing_source_classes":["项目级方案偏离管理SOP"],"target":"12.4节中方案偏离分级标准"},{"action":"确认偏离报告的具体时限、报告对象及伦理委员会通知要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_4_deviation_reporting","missing_source_classes":["偏离报告模板与时限规定"],"target":"12.4节中偏离报告时限与流程"},{"action":"确认DMC是否审阅方案偏离报告及偏离对安全性评估的影响判定规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_4_dmc_deviation_review","missing_source_classes":["DMC章程"],"target":"12.4节中DMC对方案偏离的审阅权限"}],"heading":"方案偏离","missing_source_classes":["项目级方案偏离管理SOP","偏离分级标准","偏离报告模板与时限规定"],"proposal_text":"根据GCP要求，未经申办者和伦理委员会的同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案，但不包括为了及时消除对受试者的紧急危害或者更换监查员、电话号码等仅涉及临床试验管理方面的改动。研究者应识别、记录并报告所有方案偏离，包括偏离发生的时间、原因、对受试者安全与数据完整性的影响以及已采取的纠正措施。方案偏离的报告应遵循申办者规定的报告路径与时限，重大方案偏离须及时通知申办者医学监查员及伦理委员会。","rationale":"依据公司语料中GCP方案修订条款撰写偏离管理框架。本项目为多中心III期研究，已确认设立DMC，但允许来源中未提供方案偏离分级标准（如重大偏离与一般偏离的界定）、具体报告时限、偏离对数据分析集的影响规则及DMC对偏离的审阅权限等项目级实施文件，需医学经理确认偏离管理细则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_79d7e2265d0f701f","section_number":"12.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:779e0467d0a3503adeb1d7b4","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"a59c8e6fe4ce8f445b603bffce72cefd035f5051179be0bad396a3365507397e","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_e54ab29f43100c76:full-draft:779e0467d0a3503adeb1d7b4","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:779e0467d0a3503adeb1d7b4","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:d4bcfda355db92494e1792b8a712f5912f5c5f0842d8a34c2adf2dcffe0add9e:779e0467d0a3503adeb1d7b4","text_sha256":"a59c8e6fe4ce8f445b603bffce72cefd035f5051179be0bad396a3365507397e"},{"content_sha256":"01acde550034c139002b127618cadca82a0894fdead88903d47425241f006b8c","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","text_sha256":"01acde550034c139002b127618cadca82a0894fdead88903d47425241f006b8c"},{"content_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","ro